Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it going well, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. Exactly as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard from me #193...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,...and me #238 not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to dilly-dally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time for the next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us meet again soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,On the path to Hades.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In Hell on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.65,0:02:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.57,0:02:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but what a cute lunch that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd feel guilty if I didn't share, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you take some of mine as a trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A battle's taking place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Two pros are facing off,\Njust like in manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Insight. I think I see their auras.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:12.17,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Meow"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Having trouble deciding?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'll take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's Shido for you.\NIt's super delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn. Say "Ah!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's delicious.\NI'm always the one making the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't had anyone else's\Nhome cooking in forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.61,0:04:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my. You exaggerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Care for another?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do try my egg omelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.03,0:04:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! I don't get it, but I'm impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka, stand back. It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Grr! How dare they show off without us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreement. We want to compete, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,These bonito flakes!\NThis is no ordinary soy sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here. There's seaweed in it.\NAnd tuna, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I interest you in some of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.95,0:05:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot... miso soup?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.71,0:05:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we chalk this up as another tie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,--Whoa!\N--Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Could you hold still for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any plans\Nafter school next Wednesday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wednesday? Sorry, but I'm\Ndoing something I can't miss:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.03,0:05:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Going on a date with the girl\Nin front of me, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:06:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my. My, my. I see we have\Nthe same thing in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your time in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. But you don't mean\N"Thanks for your time" in the normal way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What a funny thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can interpret it\Nthe standard way, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,However, when it comes to\Nthe day in question...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to do exactly what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:07:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That went well. Kurumi's levels\Nhad some swings there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.81,0:07:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, a certain someone's\Nlevels swung just as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Erk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why did Kurumi pick next Wednesday?\NIs there something then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Next Wednesday...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:19.87,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Holidays: Valentine's Day"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You get chocolate from people\Nthat like you?! Wow, what a fun day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're right about that,\Nbut you're on the giving side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay. I'm happy\Nto give Shido something...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're clearly disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi plans to win their battle\Nwith a Valentine's date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And if Darling loses,\Nshe'll take his Spirit power and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:08:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt Shido will admit defeat\Nif doing so costs his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi wouldn't challenge him\Nunless she thought she could win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We have two plays here: One is for\Nall of us to give him chocolate, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Drown her out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,True... If I was a guy and only got\Nchocolate from Kurumin,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd fall for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wise plan, but I was\Ngiving him some anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.81,0:08:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the other play we have is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami? Or Miku, or Nia?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--That's Shido for you.\N--Nice guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Given your choices, it's no surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,May I, Shido? Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We girls\Nwill take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. With some experience,\NKurumi's nothing to be afraid of!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.15,0:09:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,--Good grief!\N--Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're up to,\Ngo back to your rooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Aww, that's no fun!\N--I knew it wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez! What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it now? Don't tell me... Kurumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? That's Shido Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks pretty normal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? I think he's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're DEM's thing...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You know us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling us "DEM's thing" is so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:10:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We're proper Spirits, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're called Nibeelcole.\NCool name, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But since Father made us,\Nwe're different than the Spirits you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits? Father? Made you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Confused?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We could explain,\Nbut it's pointless. Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,...you're gonna die anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Camael's regeneration, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gonna make this annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no fair if you can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.32,0:10:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever. We'll just\Nkill him till he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Koto... ri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.61,0:11:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The bare legs of your Big Sis, perhaps?\NYou're a guy, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Big Sis?! You're Kotori... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be. But what are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? "Those"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you had a growth spurt,\Nthat doesn't explain those boob--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, Mom needs you to taste test.\NBy the way, I'm Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Could you help me, Son?\NI mean... sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido! I mean... Itsuka!\NIt's time for Health Ed. class.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, a stamen and a pistil...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad you weren't here\Nwhen I didn't have a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did you come to take it off\Nyourself, you bad boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oho, do you have a boo-boo?\NWhere does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Point. Even as an adult,\Nyou talk like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Are you awake, Mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:46.82,On Top,,0,0,0,,"We tried to get a head start"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We failed, but refuse to give up.\NWho said a little girl can't be a big sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:13:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Grr! Why were we made small?!\NI wanna help Darling out, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With us for contrast,\Nit's easier to see their "assets."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.93,0:13:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's training.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.47,0:13:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Training?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,To ensure you don't fall victim\Nto Kurumi Tokisaki's sexiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,To better resist Kurumi, you need to get\Nused to a mature girl's charms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... You used Natsumi's\NHaniel to transform?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's resume the training.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Itsuka! You're late for\NTohka-{\i1}sensei{\i}'s Naughty Class!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy! You can touch 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, come spend\Nan indulgent night with Muku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh, jeez! I can't take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.81,0:13:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Itsuka?!\NClass is in session!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:13:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Reine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:20.50,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Baking Chocolate"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on to the next plan.\NReine got these ingredients for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't know what to do,\Nask me or Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... So many ingredients\Nto choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, what's the difference between\Nthese light and dark colors?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The milk to cocoa ratio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.07,0:14:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, darker means it's more bitter,\Nand lighter means its sweeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.82,0:14:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oho, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of chocolate will you make?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Just melting it\Ninto a shape feels so uninspired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, if it's too involved,\NI might mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're probably worrying over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of who you're giving it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Will they disapprove of something\Nyou made just because it's simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right--I'm overthinking things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori, Reine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to make chocolate\Nthat I can drizzle over my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna make him some\Nsuper-energy-boost bars!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What should go in it? Softshell--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Make normal chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.84,0:15:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Silicone for a mold case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A mold of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.31,0:16:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. But there's just\None problem with that:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Think how much volume\Nthere is in a human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin would consume\Nan excessive amount of sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't consider that.\NHow embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too busy thinking about Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, keep his health in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll size it down\Nwhile maintaining the quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to drag you into this\Non your day off, Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I've always wondered, Reine:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you refer to Shido as Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:17:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought his name was Shintaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've kept calling him that ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I suppose I should get\Nstarted on mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.13,0:17:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You? Huh? Who for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.55,0:17:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the Fraxinus crew, my colleagues\Nat Raizen High, and Shin, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.19,0:17:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww! I thought maybe\Nyou found someone special!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you,\Nbut there's no one like that these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.36,0:17:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmation. You said, "these days."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.99,0:17:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? So there was someone\Nyou liked in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.25,0:17:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,--Really?\N--Are you serious?\N--For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm, there was. Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,--Ooh!\N--Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.34,0:17:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked. What were they like?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's someone Reine liked,\NI bet they were lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he was very kind.\NSuch a kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt that anyone--past or future--\Ncan surpass his place in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He was my first love...\Nand will be my last love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.95,0:18:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful story, Ms. Murasame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.17,0:18:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is where you live?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it just lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I was planning to give\NShido some chocolate, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, may I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:18:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you can join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed. It's a good chance to get\Ndata on her. I'll return to Fraxinus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.37,0:19:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, since I have permission,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get started right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido's heart shall be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not happening! I'll protect Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't go your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.73,0:19:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:38.69,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Baking Chocolate"\N"Hokkaido Fresh Cream"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Kotori... How do I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori? How do you melt chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.03,0:19:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, Kotori. Is it your first time\Ntempering chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Of course, I've done it before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempering...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Temper... ing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Temper... Tenpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Melting chocolate is as easy as this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.57,0:20:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take the pot off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Origami, you know how\Nto make chocolate, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well... I'm not super confident,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think I know the basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My savior!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,--Happy Valentine's!\N--Happy Valentine's!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.45,0:21:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone! I've never gotten\Nthis much chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, don't lose to that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They give you more at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat our chocolate\Nand do your best, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, what comes next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.81,0:21:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Next is our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.10,0:21:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. Godspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,To a good death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,To a meaningful demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.74,0:21:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.37,0:21:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And... Shido's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:54.96,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 10:\N'Girl Time.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Kurumi Tokisaki\Nwas a normal human.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.55,0:23:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did she end up as "The Worst Spirit"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.22,0:23:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Past Sins."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:39.94,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 11: 'Past Sins.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.89,0:23:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi's past is unfolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.64,0:23:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.65,0:23:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
